1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:11,560
As social media is used more and more extensively, there is a growing awareness of the importance of using it properly and responsibly.
随着社交媒体的使用越来越广泛，人们日益认识到合理、负责地使用它的重要性。

2
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:21,990
Platforms such as WeChat and Weibo have made it easier than ever to share information, but they have also brought problems like rumors, online abuse and addiction.
微信、微博等平台让分享信息变得前所未有的容易，但它们也带来了谣言、网络暴力和成瘾等问题。

3
00:00:22,790 --> 00:00:28,060
Using social media properly means, first of all, using it in moderation.
合理使用社交媒体，首先意味着要适度使用。

4
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:36,190
Spending hours scrolling through endless posts not only wastes valuable time but also harms our sleep and concentration.
花几个小时刷看无穷无尽的帖子，不仅浪费宝贵的时间，还会损害我们的睡眠和注意力。

5
00:00:36,990 --> 00:00:41,680
Using it responsibly means thinking twice before posting or sharing anything.
负责任地使用社交媒体，意味着在发布或转发任何内容之前都要三思。

6
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:48,990
A rumor forwarded carelessly can cause panic, and a thoughtless comment may deeply hurt someone we have never met.
随手转发的一条谣言可能引起恐慌，一句欠考虑的评论可能深深伤害一个我们素未谋面的人。

7
00:00:49,790 --> 00:00:59,160
Moreover, we should protect our own privacy and respect that of others, since personal information, once posted online, is very hard to take back.
此外，我们应该保护自己的隐私，也要尊重他人的隐私，因为个人信息一旦发布到网上，就很难收回。

8
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:08,260
To achieve this, each of us should develop good habits, such as setting time limits and checking the source of a message before passing it on.
要做到这一点，我们每个人都应该养成良好的习惯，比如设定时间限制，在转发信息之前核实其来源。

9
00:01:09,060 --> 00:01:15,340
Platforms, for their part, should tighten their oversight of content and remove false or harmful posts promptly.
平台方面，则应加强对内容的监管，及时删除虚假或有害的帖子。

10
00:01:16,140 --> 00:01:21,900
If everyone acts responsibly, social media will become a truly positive force in our lives.
如果每个人都负责任地行事，社交媒体就会成为我们生活中一股真正积极的力量。
